Suggests: xzram-gui
Description: Cross-distro Linux swap management (CLI and daemon)
 XZram provides a CLI, privileged helper, and D-Bus daemon for zram, swap
 files, sysctl tuning, and configuration snapshots on systemd-based
 distributions.

Package: xzram-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         xzram (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Qt6 GUI for XZram swap management
 Desktop GUI for XZram that shells out to the xzram CLI for status, staging,
 and polkit-gated apply.
